/* 3个小型节令（春分/夏至后夜/初雪 × 3段）+ 6段区域瞬时事件（先登记后前往）+ 便条册（共18段） */

:: MP Micro Festivals Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
<<set $mpMicroNotice to ($mpMicroNotice or {})>>
高街布告栏下方的窄木槽里插着几枚按节气更换的竹签水牌，旁边还挂着一册镇外六处秘境的巡检便条夹。塞拉路过时顺手替最左边那枚竹签拨正了红绳，说这些不写进大日历的小节令，往往只有老街坊和跑夜路的人才会凑在一起搭把手。
<<set _m to Time.date.month>><<set _d to Time.date.day>>
<<if not ((_m is 3 and _d gte 14 and _d lte 24) or (_m is 6 and _d gte 20 and _d lte 30) or (_m is 12 and _d gte 1) or _m is 1 or (_m is 2 and _d lte 10))>>
水牌上眼下没有临近的小节令，只有几枚空竹签在微风里轻轻相碰。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

<<investigateicon>><<link [[翻巡检便条夹 (0:02)|MP Micro Region Notices 1]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查半日铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if _m is 3 and _d gte 14 and _d lte 24>>
	<<link [[去神殿分苗牌 (0:04)|MP Festival Vernal 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 6 and _d gte 20 and _d lte 30>>
	<<link [[去海礁放漂灯 (0:04)|MP Festival Midsummer 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_m is 12 and _d gte 1) or _m is 1 or (_m is 2 and _d lte 10)>>
	<<link [[去孤儿院封窗 (0:04)|MP Festival FirstSnow 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: MP Micro Region Notices 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroNotice to ($mpMicroNotice or {})>>
便条夹前半册钉着来自海岸、地底机括与沉没修道院的三张炭笔便条。你凑近辨认上面的字迹，记下地点后便可改日亲自过去查看。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合夹回水牌前 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻到便条后册 (0:02)|MP Micro Region Notices 2]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="micro-notice-1">
<<investigateicon>><<link "抄铜钟便条 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<set $mpMicroNotice["foghorn_bell"] to 1>><<replace "#micro-notice-1">>你折角记下雾角栈桥铜钟被海藻缠住的方位。<span class="green">改日去雾角灯塔岛时可顺路查看。</span><</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抄油杯便条 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<set $mpMicroNotice["clockwork_oil"] to 1>><<replace "#micro-notice-1">>你记下三号主轴滴油杯凝脂堵塞的位置。<span class="green">改日去钟塔地底机括城时可顺路处理。</span><</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抄断芯便条 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<set $mpMicroNotice["abbey_wick"] to 1>><<replace "#micro-notice-1">>你记下修道院外庭引路石龛灯芯结炭的线索。<span class="green">改日去沉没修道院时可顺路拨亮。</span><</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Micro Region Notices 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroNotice to ($mpMicroNotice or {})>>
便条夹后半册钉着来自秘密温室、黑铁货运站与深林古石环的三张巡检便条。纸角沾着泥点与松脂，记着几处亟待搭手的小麻烦。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[合夹回水牌前 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[翻回便条前册 (0:02)|MP Micro Region Notices 1]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="micro-notice-2">
<<investigateicon>><<link "抄喷嘴便条 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<set $mpMicroNotice["glasshouse_nozzle"] to 1>><<replace "#micro-notice-2">>你记下温室北侧藤架喷淋嘴结碱的方位。<span class="green">改日去秘密温室庄园时可顺路疏通。</span><</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抄铁楔便条 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<set $mpMicroNotice["blackiron_wedge"] to 1>><<replace "#micro-notice-2">>你记下二号副股道扳道器卡入铁楔的位置。<span class="green">改日去黑铁货运站时可顺路敲松。</span><</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抄石槽便条 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<set $mpMicroNotice["druid_conduit"] to 1>><<replace "#micro-notice-2">>你记下月泉引水石槽被枯枝松脂堵塞的线索。<span class="green">改日去德鲁伊石环时可顺路清开。</span><</replace>><</link>>
</div>

/* ==================== 1. 春分 (Vernal Equinox · 3段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Vernal 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
春分清晨的露水挂在神殿后园的药草垄上。乔丹端着两盘春播香草幼苗走出来，准备分给花圃与孤儿院，却发现北侧那排迷迭香根土里混进了白石粉，若不趁移栽前筛洗干净，种下去很快就会枯萎。
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>蒙蒙春雨打湿了石阶，泥土气息格外浓郁。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿前庭 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[泉边筛洗迷迭香 (0:08)|MP Festival Vernal 2]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_clean"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_clean"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[验苗床白石粉 (0:06)|MP Festival Vernal 2]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_powder"] to 1>><<stress -1>><<else>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Vernal 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
你帮乔丹把春分幼苗木盘抬到公园花坛，诺艾尔已备好了腐叶土。
<<if $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_clean"] is 1>>洗净的迷迭香须根洁白完好，诺艾尔欣喜地向你点头。<<elseif $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_powder"] is 1>>你把误放的白石粉交给花匠核对，及时换上了备用新苗。<<else>>几株幼苗叶尖发蔫，你和诺艾尔挑出受损苗株重新修剪。<</if>>
一阵春风忽然吹翻花坛边的立蛋铜架，几枚彩绘熟蛋眼看就要滚下石阶。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[俯身接彩蛋 (0:05)|MP Festival Vernal 3]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_egg"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_egg"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 5>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[招呼学徒挡石阶 (0:05)|MP Festival Vernal 3]]>>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_egg"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_egg"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 5>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Vernal 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
傍晚春分小集散去时，高街长桌上摆满了街坊回赠的春菜馅饼与接骨木花蜜水。
<<if $mpMicroFestClues["vernal_egg"] is 1>>
	彩绘立蛋稳稳竖在铜架上，乔丹与诺艾尔把两小盆迷迭香放进你的提篮。<span class="green">春播分苗顺顺当当地落下了帷幕。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_vernal_reward")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">你收下了 £6 护苗补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>>
<<else>>
	虽然碎了两枚彩绘蛋、手背擦红一块，但香草苗总算按时分完。<span class="teal">诺艾尔塞给你一只热馅饼暖手。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_vernal_reward")>><<money 300>><</if>>
	<<stress -2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

/* ==================== 2. 夏至后夜 (Midsummer Eve · 3段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Midsummer 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
夏至后的第一个夜晚，海平线直到九点才合拢暮色。镇民在退潮的海礁浅湾放出一排贝壳蜂蜡漂灯测试夏夜暗潮，然而东南风偏急，十几盏贝壳灯全被横浪推向了尖锐的牡蛎礁区。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海礁 (0:02)|Sea Rocks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "searocks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<swimicon>><<link [[蹚浅湾拨木挡 (0:08)|MP Festival Midsummer 2]]>>
	<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_tide"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_tide"] to 0>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[重布导流绳 (0:07)|MP Festival Midsummer 2]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_tide"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_tide"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Midsummer 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
暖黄的蜂蜡漂灯顺着浅湾绕过海角，汇聚到海滩南侧木栈桥下。格威岚拿着记潮板守在篝火桶旁，罗宾也在岸边捞起熄灭的贝壳灯添蜡。
<<if $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_tide"] is 1>>十九盏贝壳灯一盏不落地漂进浅滩，在海面拉出一条星带。<<else>>有几盏灯在牡蛎石边磕灭了，你挽起裤腿帮罗宾挑出打湿的灯芯。<</if>>
海风忽然卷起未捆紧的一叠记潮油纸，眼看就要飘进篝火火星里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[跃起按住油纸 (0:05)|MP Festival Midsummer 3]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_notes"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_notes"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 5>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[湿竹篓罩纸页 (0:05)|MP Festival Midsummer 3]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_notes"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_notes"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 5>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Midsummer 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
午夜前海风转凉，众人回到海风咖啡馆露台下分喝冰镇薄荷柠檬饮。
<<if $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_tide"] is 1 and $mpMicroFestClues["midsummer_notes"] is 1>>
	暗潮海图记录完整，罗宾把一枚珍珠母贝壳灯座塞进你口袋留念。<span class="green">整晚的测潮差事办得滴水不漏。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_midsummer_reward")>><<money 650>><span class="gold">你领到了 £6.50 夏夜测潮补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>>
<<else>>
	记潮纸虽被燎焦一角，好在主要潮位数据都保住了。<span class="teal">冰凉柠檬饮吹散了奔跑后的燥热。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_midsummer_reward")>><<money 350>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:03)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

/* ==================== 3. 初雪 (First Snow · 3段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival FirstSnow 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
入冬第一场细雪落满孤儿院屋瓦。孩子们熬了一锅麦粉浆糊准备给北窗糊防风牛皮纸，然而顶楼天窗铁搭扣被冻霜卡死，冷风直往楼梯井灌，浆糊盆不一会儿就结了硬皮。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回孤儿院 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[兑盐水调浆糊 (0:07)|MP Festival FirstSnow 2]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_paste"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_paste"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[踩梯撬天窗扣 (0:06)|MP Festival FirstSnow 2]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_paste"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_paste"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival FirstSnow 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
封好孤儿院北窗后，你拎着剩余纸卷来到宅邸街交界的守夜岗棚。林恩正带着街坊给路灯供气阀裹草绳。
<<if $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_paste"] is 1>>你用耐寒浆糊帮岗棚把漏风窗角也封得严严实实。<<else>>你在孤儿院返工耽搁片刻，林恩递给你半只热红薯暖手。<</if>>
这时一辆送煤平板马车在结冰坡道上打滑，车尾两袋无烟煤眼看就要砸中路边的热汤桶。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[塞木楔卡车轮 (0:05)|MP Festival FirstSnow 3]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_cart"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_cart"] to 0>><<stress 4>><<pain 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 5>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[往车轮撒煤渣 (0:05)|MP Festival FirstSnow 3]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_cart"] to 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_cart"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 5>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival FirstSnow 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpMicroFestClues to ($mpMicroFestClues or {})>>
初雪夜渐深，孤儿院厨房铁炉上煨着姜丝红糖水，封严的木窗外再无穿堂寒风。
<<if $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_paste"] is 1 and $mpMicroFestClues["firstsnow_cart"] is 1>>
	车夫特意往煤仓多卸了两袋上等块煤，罗宾捧着热姜汤笑盈盈地迎上来。<span class="green">孤儿院与街口岗棚都备足了过冬暖意。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_firstsnow_reward")>><<money 600>><span class="gold">你领到了 £6 初雪防寒补贴。</span><</if>>
	<<stress -6>><<tiredness -2>>
<<else>>
	你虽在冰坡上滑了一下磕痛膝盖，好在北窗都已封严。<span class="teal">喝完热姜汤后，冻僵的四肢渐渐回暖。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_firstsnow_reward")>><<money 300>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回卧室歇息 (0:02)|Bedroom]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "bedroom">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回水牌 (0:03)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

/* ==================== 4. 6段区域瞬时事件 (由各区域入口触发并返回区域入口) ==================== */

:: MP Region Micro Foghorn Bell [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpMicroNotice>><<set $mpMicroNotice["foghorn_bell"] to 0>><<run delete $mpMicroNotice["foghorn_bell"]>><</if>>
雾角灯塔栈桥尽头的自动报雾铜钟被海藻缠住了连杆，每当大浪涌过浮筒，钟舌只能发出沉闷哑响。浓雾里一艘驳船正在栈桥外摸索航向。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角岛 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="micro-foghorn-bell">
<<investigateicon>><<link "割断连杆海藻 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#micro-foghorn-bell">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($athletics or 0) gte 280>>
你扣紧铁环割断墨绿海带，铜钟重新敲响洪亮警示音。<span class="green">你在钟座卡槽里摸到一枚旧港银币。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("micro_region_foghorn_bell")>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -3>>
<<else>>
咸滑海藻让刀尖一偏，浪头扑湿了半边衣袖。<span class="red">你的指节在铜钟边缘磕青了一块。</span>
<<pain 2>><<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Micro Clockwork Oil [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpMicroNotice>><<set $mpMicroNotice["clockwork_oil"] to 0>><<run delete $mpMicroNotice["clockwork_oil"]>><</if>>
钟塔地底机括城三号主传动轴旁，黄铜滴油杯滤网被陈年鲸油堵死，底下轴承干磨发出刺耳尖啸，火星直往格栅下掉。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="micro-clockwork-oil">
