<<if ($science or 0) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
你旋紧副阀拧下滤网，借泄压白汽将凝脂冲净。<span class="green">你在底座暗槽摸到了备用铜牌补贴。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("micro_region_clockwork_oil")>><<money 350>><</if>>
<<stress -3>>
<<else>>
你没算准泄压时机，拧盖时热油溅在手背上。<span class="red">呛人油烟熏得你连退两步。</span>
<<pain 3>><<stress 4>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Micro Abbey Wick [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpMicroNotice>><<set $mpMicroNotice["abbey_wick"] to 0>><<run delete $mpMicroNotice["abbey_wick"]>><</if>>
沉没修道院外庭中段的引路石龛里，长明铜灯的灯芯结了厚厚一团黑炭花，火苗缩成绿豆大小，石阶上一片幽暗。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回修道院 (0:03)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="micro-abbey-wick">
<<tendingicon>><<link "铜镊挑灯芯炭花 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#micro-abbey-wick">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
你用双股铜镊夹去炭花，把浸在没药油里的亚麻芯拨高半寸。<span class="green">灯火照亮了底座下压着的奉纳银币。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("micro_region_abbey_wick")>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -3>>
<<else>>
你手腕微抖，铜镊把灯芯压进了灯油里，石龛瞬间暗下。<span class="red">阴冷穿堂风让你后背一阵发毛。</span>
<<stress 5>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Region Micro Glasshouse Nozzle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $mpMicroNotice>><<set $mpMicroNotice["glasshouse_nozzle"] to 0>><<run delete $mpMicroNotice["glasshouse_nozzle"]>><</if>>
秘密温室庄园北侧藤架下，一只恒温喷淋铜嘴被水碱堵偏了方向，温热水柱正对着过道旁的园艺记录簿直喷。
